# ─── OS CLUTTER ───
# Hidden system files that clutter folders when you view images/PDFs
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── IDE & EDITOR CONFIGURATIONS ───
# If you edit your README locally using VS Code or similar
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp

# ─── TEMPORARY & BACKUP FILES ───
# Prevents accidental uploads of duplicate or autosaved PDFs/images
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
.#*

# ─── DESIGN TOOL JUNK ───
# If you use Photoshop or Illustrator to crop screenshots of certificates
*.psd
*.ai
